caption: Vampire Field Manual — 🩸 Local Field Note: Nocthollow Vampires
campaign-component: local-field-note-nocthollow-vampires

(Prepared jointly with the Office of Eryndor Relations and Starbucks Legal Division)

The Nocthollow strain exhibits all classical undead markers with extreme magical amplification. Contractors are not authorized to initiate conflict without express regional clearance.

Observed Traits:

Sunlight: Burns rapidly; aura dims even artificial light.

Weaknesses: Holy power, silver, natural wood, and fire.

Resistance: Exceptional strength, reflexes, and charm abilities.

Behavior: Hierarchical; nobles often maintain “thralls” (enchanted servants).

Environmental Note: Manifest stronger abilities in high-mana zones (city cathedrals, ley crossings, Starbucks Wi-Fi hotspots).

Recommended Actions:

Maintain formal respect and eye contact under 3 seconds.

If approached diplomatically, treat as client — not quarry.

If hostility occurs, disengage and notify Regional Management.

If compelled or charmed: file Form 6-B (“Enthralled or Emotionally Conflicted”). HR will debrief post-release.
